O6SJc6mJsp3","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-08T20:16:04Z","updated_at":"2025-04-08T20:22:52Z","body":"@Pixelstyx ... I've noticed this as well and had to work around it to repo another issue. \n\nI've actually created a repo for another bug but was able to work around this issue in some degree while creating a flat repo of the other issue. \nhttps://github.com/uno1982/GodotPanoramaSkyAdjustments\n\nkeep in mind this repo crashes godot with intent however you'll see the FPSPlayer gd script in here that has a code block like this. \n\nhttps://github.com/uno1982/GodotPanoramaSkyAdjustments/blob/86e1a6ffd2581d715e7051064314201b37baf346/addons/Basic%20FPS%20Player/Src/basic_player_startup.gd#L125C1-L145C40\n\nif you make your input \"joystick control\" for example large enough it will filter the events of this area similar to the way handle event would \"stop\" propagation. I know it's not the solution but it's a way to work around this for now. \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f974bc0-843f-4deb-9a58-fc01deabe6ae)\n\nJust give your control a bit of a buffer area to ignore the gestureinput from your camera ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2787560055/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]